              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "IMVINTAGE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Thsi was a nice twist on an old favorite but it didnt \"wow\" me. I really liked the lime though. Next time, I think I will use crushed red pepper to get a stronger flavor. (I didn't remove the fennel seeds either) I laid it on a bed of curly parsley &amp; garnished w/ minced onions. Wsa a nice side to Shrimp Burritos...thanks!",
